BOOK:Full_anisotropic_shell
NUMBER: 5 MATERIAL: Full_anisotropic_shell
HELP: This property must be assigned to orthotropic shells. 'Thickness' is the transversal dimension of the shell. 'Ex' and 'Ey' are the Young Modulus and 'nuXY' 'nuYX' are the Poisson coefficient. 'Gxy', 'Gxz' and 'Gyz' are the shear modulus\nUnits in International System for values are:\n\t (m) for the thickness\n\t(N/m2) for 'Ex','Ey', 'Gxy', 'Gxz' and 'Gyz' \n\t(adimensional) 'nuXY' 'nuYX'\n\t(N/m3) for the Specific_weight.
